The EXL3 format turboexl3 decodes (the MUL1 and MCG codebooks, the trellis
packing, the tensor-core permutation and the Hadamard suh / svh transforms)
follows exllamav3 v1.4.2 (codebook.cuh, exl3_dq.cuh, pack.cu, hadamard.cu,
quantize.py); src/format.zig and src/lane.zig cite what they reproduce.

