mlx-serve
https://github.com/ddalcu/mlx-serve
Copyright (c) 2026 David Dalcu
Licensed under the MIT License.

Where a turboexl3 kernel replaces a chain of mlx-serve's own kernels byte for
byte, it repeats their statements: the fused MoE router (softmax mode), the
QSA split-K merge, the hd-128 and hd-256 QK-norm + RoPE, the table SwiGLU and
the strided sigmoid gate. Each site names the kernel it follows.
